#. translators: 1: Solemnity name, 2: Coinciding Solemnity name, 3: Requested calendar year
#: src/Handlers/CalendarHandler.php:1370
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The Solemnity '%1$s' coincides with the Solemnity '%2$s' in the year %3$d. "
"We should ask the Dicastery for Divine Worship and the Discipline of the "
"Sacraments what to do about this!"
msgstr ""
"La solennité '%1$s' coïncide avec la solennité '%2$s' en l'année %3$d. Nous "
"devrions demander au Dicastère pour le Culte Divin et la Discipline des "
"Sacrements quoi faire à ce sujet !"

#. translators:
